{"id": "1705372", "name": "מטריצת מעבר בין סטנדרטי לבסיס נוסף + וקטור קורדינאטות בפולינומים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randPoly", "params": ["n"], "body": "sum(rand_with_prohib(-1,1,[0])*x^i,i,0, n)"}, {"name": "vectToPoly", "params": ["vect"], "body": "sum(vect[i][1]*x^(i-1),i,1, length(vect))"}, {"name": "polyToVect", "params": ["poly", "n"], "body": "transpose(makelist(coeff(poly, x, i),i,0,n))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונים בסיסים סדורים למרחב הפולינומים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}_{\\leq {{CT:0}}}[x]\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[E = {{CT:1}}\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[B = {{CT:2}}\\]</p></div><p>חשבו את מטריצות המעבר</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([I]^{B}_{E}=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([I]^{E}_{B}=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ג׳</span></div><p>עבור הפולינום</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[p(x)={{CT:3}}\\]</p><p>חשבו את וקטור הקואורדינטות</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([p(x)]_{B}=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> העמודות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{B}_{E}\\)</span> הן וקטורי המקדמים של הפולינומים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span>; <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{E}_{B}\\)</span> היא ההופכית שלה; ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\([p]_B\\)</span> מתקבל מהכפלת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{E}_{B}\\)</span> בווקטור המקדמים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — המטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{B}_{E}\\)</span> (סעיף א׳)</b><br>לפי ההגדרה, העמודה ה-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(j\\)</span> של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{B}_{E}\\)</span> היא וקטור הקואורדינטות, לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(E\\)</span>, של הווקטור ה-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(j\\)</span> בבסיס <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span>. כך מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{B}_{E}\\,[v]_{B}=[v]_{E}\\)</span> לכל וקטור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v\\)</span>.<br>נסמן את הפולינומים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span> לפי הסדר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(b_1,b_2,b_3\\)</span>. וקטור הקואורדינטות של פולינום לפי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(E\\)</span> הוא וקטור המקדמים שלו, לפי הסדר: המקדם החופשי, המקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x\\)</span> והמקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^2\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ [b_1]_E=\\left[{{CT:4}}\\right]_E={{CT:5}},\\quad [b_2]_E=\\left[{{CT:6}}\\right]_E={{CT:7}},\\quad [b_3]_E=\\left[{{CT:8}}\\right]_E={{CT:9}} \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ [I]^{B}_{E}={{CT:10}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — המטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{E}_{B}\\)</span> (סעיף ב׳)</b><br>מכפילים: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{E}_{B}\\,[I]^{B}_{E}\\,[q]_B=[I]^{E}_{B}\\,[q]_E=[q]_B\\)</span> לכל פולינום <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(q\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{E}_{B}=\\left([I]^{B}_{E}\\right)^{-1}\\)</span>. הדטרמיננטה היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\det [I]^{B}_{E}={{CT:11}}\\)</span>, ודירוג של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left[\\,[I]^{B}_{E}\\;\\middle|\\;I\\,\\right]\\)</span> נותן:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ [I]^{E}_{B}=\\left([I]^{B}_{E}\\right)^{-1}={{CT:12}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — וקטור הקואורדינטות (סעיף ג׳)</b><br>וקטור המקדמים של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p\\)</span> הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([p]_E={{CT:13}}\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ [p(x)]_B=[I]^{E}_{B}\\,[p]_E={{CT:12}}{{CT:13}}={{CT:14}} \\]</p>בדיקה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:15}}={{CT:16}}=p(x)\\)</span>.</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>[[feedback:prt3]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "IBE", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "IEB", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "rep", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ג׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["Bpoly", "E", "Epoly", "IBE", "IEB", "matrixEntry", "n", "rPoly", "rPolyVec", "rep"], "nvariants": 50}